OL,3,GNEWSARoad closed by third sinkhole in
OL,4,A10 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FOnce again, a sinkhole has appeared on
OL,7,Fa road in a town in Greater Manchester
OL,8,F- marking the third time the same road
OL,9,Fhas been impacted over the course of 10
OL,10,Fyears.
OL,12,FHeywood Road in Prestwich, Bury, has
OL,13,Fbeen closed, and traffic diverted,
OL,14,Fafter two or three large cracks caused
OL,15,Fthe tarmac to dip dramatically.
OL,17,FIt is the third sinkhole on the road
OL,18,Fwithin a decade, with one first
OL,19,Fappearing in 2016 and another occurring
OL,20,Fon the same street in 2023.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
